  <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
    <CloudflareLogo variant="horizontal" height={20} />
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Solutions</a>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Docs</a>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Pricing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
    <Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Log in</Button>
    <Button variant="primary" size="sm">Sign up</Button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Breadcrumb nav -->
<nav class="bg-kumo-elevated border-b border-kumo-hairline h-10 px-6 flex items-center">
  <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm">
    <li>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Home</a>
    </li>
    <li class="text-kumo-subtle">/</li>
    <li>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
    </li>
    <li class="text-kumo-subtle">/</li>
    <li class="text-kumo-default font-medium">Workers</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<div class="bg-kumo-canvas p-8 text-center text-kumo-subtle text-sm">
  Page content goes here
</div>`;
---

<DocLayout
  title="Navigation"
  description="A top navigation bar with logo, nav links, and call-to-action buttons. Copy into your root layout so it appears on every page."
>

  {/* Hero */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <div class="not-prose overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <div class="rounded-t-lg border border-kumo-hairline bg-kumo-canvas">
        <nav class="bg-kumo-base border-b border-kumo-hairline h-12 px-6 flex items-center justify-between rounded-t-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <CloudflareLogo variant="horizontal" height={20} />
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Solutions</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Docs</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Log in</Button>
            <Button variant="primary" size="sm">Sign up</Button>
          </div>
        </nav>
        <div class="bg-kumo-canvas p-8 text-center text-kumo-subtle text-sm">
          Page content goes here
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="component-example-code">
        <CodeBlock code={sourceCode} lang="astro" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Installation */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Installation</Heading>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Navigation is a <strong>block</strong> — a layout template you copy into your project and own. Unlike components, blocks are not imported from a package. You get the full source code and can customize it however you need.
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>1. Install dependencies</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={installCode} lang="bash" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>2. Copy into your layout file</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`# Copy the source code above into your layout, e.g.:
src/layouts/Layout.astro`} lang="bash" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-sm text-kumo-strong"><strong>3. Update links</strong></p>
        <CodeBlock code={`<!-- Replace the href="javascript:void(0)" values with your actual routes -->`} lang="astro" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Usage */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Usage</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">
      Drop into your root layout file so it appears on every page. Wrap your page <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">&lt;slot /&gt;</code> below the nav.
    </p>
    <CodeBlock code={usageCode} lang="astro" />
  </ComponentSection>

  {/* Examples */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>Examples</Heading>

    <Heading level={3}>With Active State</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">Highlight the current page link with <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">text-kumo-default font-medium</code> and a bottom border indicator using <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">bg-kumo-brand</code>.</p>

    <ComponentExample code={activeStateCode} lang="astro">
      <div class="w-full">
        <nav class="bg-kumo-base border-b border-kumo-hairline h-12 px-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <CloudflareLogo variant="horizontal" height={20} />
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Solutions</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="relative text-sm text-kumo-default font-medium flex flex-col items-center">
                Docs
                <span class="absolute -bottom-[17px] left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-kumo-brand rounded-full"></span>
              </a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Log in</Button>
            <Button variant="primary" size="sm">Sign up</Button>
          </div>
        </nav>
        <div class="bg-kumo-canvas p-8 text-center text-kumo-subtle text-sm">
          Page content goes here
        </div>
      </div>
    </ComponentExample>

    <Heading level={3} class="mt-8">Breadcrumb Nav</Heading>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-kumo-strong">A secondary navigation bar below the main nav showing the current page hierarchy. Uses <code class="rounded bg-kumo-control px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">bg-kumo-elevated</code> to distinguish from the primary nav.</p>

    <ComponentExample code={breadcrumbCode} lang="astro">
      <div class="w-full">
        <nav class="bg-kumo-base border-b border-kumo-hairline h-12 px-6 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <CloudflareLogo variant="horizontal" height={20} />
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Solutions</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Docs</a>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-sm text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Log in</Button>
            <Button variant="primary" size="sm">Sign up</Button>
          </div>
        </nav>
        <nav class="bg-kumo-elevated border-b border-kumo-hairline h-10 px-6 flex items-center">
          <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="text-kumo-subtle">/</li>
            <li>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="text-kumo-subtle hover:text-kumo-default transition-colors">Products</a>
            </li>
            <li class="text-kumo-subtle">/</li>
            <li class="text-kumo-default font-medium">Workers</li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <div class="bg-kumo-canvas p-8 text-center text-kumo-subtle text-sm">
          Page content goes here
        </div>
      </div>
    </ComponentExample>

  </ComponentSection>

  {/* API Reference */}

  <ComponentSection>
    <Heading level={2}>API Reference</Heading>
    <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Component</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Package</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Purpose</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-kumo-strong">
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">Button</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Log in and Sign up call-to-action buttons</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">Link</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Inline text links within the nav or breadcrumbs</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">CloudflareLogo</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Horizontal logo in the left side of the nav bar</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-kumo-hairline">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">Separator</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">@cloudflare/kumo-astro</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs">Optional visual divider between nav sections</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </ComponentSection>

</DocLayout>
